OL,3,AHow India became dangerously addicted
OL,4,Ato Chinese imports
OL,5,
OL,6,FTake a walk into an Indian toy shop and
OL,7,Fas well as picking up a new favourite
OL,8,Fplaything for a child, you might just
OL,9,Fget an insight into how the nation is
OL,10,Fbattling for a better economic
OL,11,Frelationship with its all-powerful
OL,12,Fneighbour China.
OL,14,FSix years ago, in an attempt to push
OL,15,Flocal manufacturing and keep
OL,16,Fsubstandard toys out of its market,
OL,17,FIndia raised tariffs on imported toys
OL,18,Ffrom 20% to 60% and eventually to 70%.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
